# Citation metadata for BioTSR (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
#
# BioTSR is not yet released: this file carries no release date and no DOI.
# Both are added when 1.0 is released (docs/RELEASING.md, section 7). The
# authors are the TSR Research Group, the authorship this repository records.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BioTSR in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "BioTSR"
abstract: >-
  BioTSR is the unified software implementation of the Triangular Spatial
  Relationship (TSR) methodology. It computes TSR keys -- integers encoding the
  shape and vertex labels of triangles drawn over a 3D structure -- for protein
  C-alpha, atomic, ligand, carbohydrate, nucleotide and cross (two-sided) method
  families on one shared scientific core, each under its standard profile.
authors:
  - name: "TSR Research Group"
    website: "https://tsrmethod.github.io/"
version: "1.0.0rc7"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/TSRMethod/BioTSR"
url: "https://tsrmethod.github.io/"
keywords:
  - "Triangular Spatial Relationship"
  - "TSR"
  - "protein structure"
  - "structural bioinformatics"
  - "PDB"
